00AA                             ; go on. Every push of the return stack ends here: for a word call the cell
00AA                             ; popped is the TOS that upper parked; for "(" and "{" it is the cell under
00AA                             ; the one that was used up.
00AA                             ; 
00AA                             ; The break key is looked at here, so at every word call and loop-back (and
00AA                             ; block entry and "{"), but only one time in 256: BRKCNT counts them. Reading
00AA                             ; the keyboard can be slow (it is a BDOS call under CP/M).
